## Upstream

Teachy continues [Clicky](https://github.com/farzaa/clicky) by [Farza](https://x.com/farzatv),
also MIT-licensed. Significant portions of the companion / overlay / voice pipeline
originate there. Thank you Farza.

## Third-party software

This product embeds or distributes:

- [Sparkle](https://sparkle-project.org/) — software update framework (MIT / Permissive)
- [PostHog](https://github.com/PostHog/posthog-ios) — analytics SDK (MIT)
- Notch UI inspiration from [boring.notch](https://github.com/TheBoredTeam/boring.notch) — reference clone may live under `reference/` locally and is not required to build Teachy

API services used at runtime (OpenRouter, AssemblyAI, etc.) are optional and configured by the operator of the Teachy proxy — they are not redistributed with this source tree.
